<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Configurações - Painel da Guilda</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #2f3136;
            --card: #36393f;
            --blue: #5865f2;
            --green: #3ba55c;
            --red: #ed4245;
            --text: #ffffff;
            --muted: #b9bbbe;
            --dark: #202225;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        nav {
            background: var(--dark);
            padding: 15px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--blue);
        }

        nav h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--blue); font-size: 20px; }
        
        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            background: #4f545c;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { background: var(--blue); }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        h1 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; padding-bottom: 10px; }

        .section-header {
            display: block;
            margin: 25px 0 10px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--blue);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        select, input[type="text"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background: var(--dark);
            border: 1px solid #444;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            outline: none;
        }
        select:focus, input:focus { border-color: var(--blue); }

        .btn-save {
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 25px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-save:hover { background: #2d7d46; }

        .setup-section {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #444;
        }

        .btn-setup {
            background: var(--blue);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .btn-setup:hover { background: #4752c4; }

        .info-box {
            background: rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.1);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <h2>🛡️ GESTÃO DA GUILDA</h2>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/dashboard">📊 Membros</a>
            <a href="/punishments">⚖️ Punições</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h1>⚙️ Configurações do Sistema</h1>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                Sempre clique em <b>Salvar Configurações</b> antes de enviar o botão de setup para o Discord.
            </div>

            <form action="/save" method="POST">
                
                <span class="section-header">Gerenciamento de Cargos</span>
                <div class="form-grid">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Cargo Staff / Oficiais (Aprovação):</label>
                        <select name="roleVerificado1">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% roles.forEach(role => { %>
                                <option value="<%= role.id %>" <%= config.roleVerificado1 == role.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= role.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Cargo Membro Oficial (Guilda):</label>
                        <select name="roleMembro">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% roles.forEach(role => { %>
                                <option value="<%= role.id %>" <%= config.roleMembro == role.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= role.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Cargo de Candidato (Pendente):</label>
                        <select name="roleCandidato">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% roles.forEach(role => { %>
                                <option value="<%= role.id %>" <%= config.roleCandidato == role.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= role.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Cargo Inicial para Remover:</label>
                        <select name="roleNovato">
                            <option value="">-- Nenhum --</option>
                            <% roles.forEach(role => { %>
                                <option value="<%= role.id %>" <%= config.roleNovato == role.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= role.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <span class="section-header">Canais do Servidor</span>
                <div class="form-grid">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Iniciar Registro (Setup):</label>
                        <select name="canalVerificacao">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalVerificacao == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Recrutamento (Fichas Pendentes):</label>
                        <select name="canalRecrutamento">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalRecrutamento == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Logs (Fichas Prontas):</label>
                        <select name="canalLogs">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalLogs == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Punições (Mute/Ban):</label>
                        <select name="canalPunicao">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalPunicao == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Regras da Guilda:</label>
                        <select name="canalRegras">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalRegras == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Canal de Aviso Guerra (Sábado):</label>
                        <select name="canalAviso">
                            <option value="">-- Selecione --</option>
                            <% channels.forEach(ch => { %>
                                <option value="<%= ch.id %>" <%= config.canalAviso == ch.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= ch.name %></option>
                            <% }) %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <span class="section-header">Mensagens e Textos</span>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Texto do Aviso de Guerra (Sábado 16h):</label>
                    <input type="text" name="msgGuerra" value="<%= config.msgGuerra || '@everyone ⚔️ A GUERRA DE GUILDA COMEÇOU!' %>">
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-save">💾 SALVAR CONFIGURAÇÕES</button>
            </form>

            <div class="setup-section">
                <span class="section-header">Ação de Setup</span>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    Isso enviará a mensagem oficial com o botão de recrutamento para o canal selecionado acima.
                </p>
                <form action="/send-setup" method="POST">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-setup">🚀 ENVIAR BOTÃO AO DISCORD</button>
                </form>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
